# FTDI reply latency 16 ms -> 1 ms.
#
# The FTDI driver holds received bytes for up to `latency_timer` ms before
# handing them to the host. On a request/response bus that caps the loop at
# ~62 Hz, and a loop that runs faster reads NOTHING and republishes a frozen
# pose. Applies to every ftdi_sio port, including the Kondo DUAL USB ADAPTER HS.
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="usb-serial", DRIVER=="ftdi_sio", ATTR{latency_timer}="1"
